dsh-researchcraft
==================

This plugin packages ResearchCraft's research persona, scientific skills
catalogue, lab notebook, and specialist subagent briefs as a DeepSeek Harness
(DSH) profile bundle.

Scientific skills are seeded from the open-source catalogue
`K-Dense-AI/scientific-agent-skills` (MIT License).

